    "title": "You intend to turn left. What are your actions?",
    "options": [
     "Perform a maneuver without stopping at an intersection",
     "Turn left and stop in the gap of the dividing line, wait for the green signal of the traffic light at the exit from the intersection and complete the maneuver",
     "Stop in front of the intersection, wait for the green traffic light at the exit of the intersection and begin the maneuver"
    ],
    "explanation": "A green traffic light gives you the right to move left, clause 6.2. In this case, you must drive in the intended direction regardless of the traffic light signal at the exit from the intersection, clause 13.7.",
